      "content": "i hear you about the bleeding thing but my doctor is never available and it's honestly too much of a hassle to make an appointment just for some knee pain. i've taken advil before and i was fine. if i really need to get the pain under control today, can i just take a stronger dose like 800mg at a time? it's just for the inflammation, it shouldn't be a big deal right?",
